---
source: sched/tests/help.rs
expression: "help_output(\"taskset\")"
---
Set or retrieve a process's CPU affinity

Usage: taskset [options] [mask] command [arg...]
       taskset [options] -p [mask] pid

Arguments:
  [ARGS]...  A CPU mask and a command to run. With -p, a PID, optionally preceded by a new mask

Options:
  -p, --pid        Operate on an existing PID
  -c, --cpu-list   Interpret mask as CPU list instead of bitmask
  -a, --all-tasks  Operate on all tasks (threads) for a given PID
  -h, --help       Print help
